---
layout: layouts/base.njk
navActive: home
description: The personal site of Sīlavāpi (formerly Ruth Cheesley) - Buddhism and dharma life, open source, digital sovereignty, and living actively with EDS.
---
{% from "macros/ui.njk" import topicCard, sectionHeading, factRow, button, articleCard, quote %}
{%- set recent = collections.posts | limit(3) -%}

<section class="band">
  <div class="container hero">
    <h1 class="hero__title">Hello, I'm Sīlavāpi.</h1>
    <hr class="rule" />
    <p class="hero__standfirst">
      You may have known me as Ruth Cheesley - I was ordained into the Triratna
      Buddhist Order in 2026 and given my new name. Same person, same work: open
      source, community, dharma, and rather a lot of running.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/blog/introducing-silavapi/">Read the story behind the name</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

{% if recent | length %}
  <section class="band" aria-label="Latest from the blog">
    <div class="container latest">
      <p class="eyebrow">Latest from the blog</p>
      <div class="latest__grid">
        {% for post in recent %}
          <h2 class="latest__title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
{% endif %}

<section class="surface-subtle-band">
  <div class="container section-y card-grid">
    {{ topicCard("users", "Community & open source", "The central focus of my life has always been around bringing people together and building community. Open source is where I found a home for that drive to connect.", "Community blog", "/blog/") }}
    {{ topicCard("accessibility", "Living with a disability", "Diagnosed at 23 with Ehlers-Danlos Syndrome, a genetic condition affecting the connective tissue in my body, I've spent most of my life working with chronic pain, joint instability and fatigue.", "Being bendy", "/blog/") }}
    {{ topicCard("flower", "Buddhism and dharma life", "A practising Buddhist for over a decade, I was ordained into the Triratna Buddhist Order in 2026. The dharma sits at the centre of everything else on this site.", "Dharma", "/dharma/") }}
    {{ topicCard("activity", "Fitness and health", "Learning how to train with a physical disability and exploring ways to push myself without injuries or flare-ups has been quite a challenge. I just completed my first ultramarathon.", "Health & fitness blog", "/blog/") }}
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
  <div class="container about">
    <div class="about__portrait">
      <img src="/assets/img/photography/portrait-05.jpg" alt="Sīlavāpi, smiling in natural window light" />
    </div>
    <div class="about__col">
      {{ sectionHeading("About", "Here's a bit about me", 2) }}
      <div>
        {% call factRow("Open source advocate") %}Long-term user and contributor to open source projects, I'm currently working full-time as Project Lead for Mautic.{% endcall %}
        {% call factRow("Public speaker") %}Speaking regularly at events around the world on a range of topics from open source to living an active life with a disability.{% endcall %}
        {% call factRow("Board member") %}Proud to be a trustee of Breathworks, helping people around the world living with pain and suffering.{% endcall %}
        {% call factRow("Ordained Buddhist") %}Ordained into the Triratna Buddhist Order in 2026, after more than twelve years of practice - Sīlavāpi is the name I was given.{% endcall %}
        {% call factRow("EDS Warrior") %}Living a full and active life with Ehlers-Danlos Syndrome, including a slight obsession with ultramarathon endurance running.{% endcall %}
      </div>
      <div class="cluster">
        {{ button("Read the blog", "/blog/", "primary") }}
        {{ button("Get in touch", "/contact/", "secondary") }}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="events">
  <img class="events__bg" src="/assets/img/photography/speaking-stage-01.jpg" alt="" />
  <div class="events__scrim"></div>
  <div class="container events__inner">
    {{ sectionHeading("Events", "Next up on the travel itinerary", 2, "I am very fortunate that my work often allows me to meet amazing people from all over the world to collaborate on and improve open source projects and communities.", "dark") }}
    <ul class="event-list">
      <li class="event-list__item">
        <span class="event-list__date">September 2026</span>
        <span class="event-list__desc">Open Source Summit Europe, Amsterdam</span>
      </li>
      <li class="event-list__item">
        <span class="event-list__date">November 2026</span>
        <span class="event-list__desc">Mautic Conference Global, online</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{% if recent | length %}
  <section aria-label="Recent writing">
    <div class="container section-y stack">
      <div class="recent-head">
        {{ sectionHeading("From the blog", "Recent writing", 2) }}
        {{ button("All posts", "/blog/", "ghost") }}
      </div>
      <div class="card-grid">
        {% for post in recent %}
          {{ articleCard({
            title: post.data.title,
            excerpt: post.data.excerpt,
            image: post.data.image,
            imageAlt: post.data.imageAlt,
            date: post.date | readableDate,
            category: post.data.category,
            tone: categories.tones[post.data.category] or "neutral",
            href: post.url
          }) }}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
{% endif %}

<section class="quote-band">
  <div class="container section-y-sm">
    {{ quote("Open source is where I found a home for that drive to connect.", "Sīlavāpi", "dark") }}
  </div>
</section>
